# The function an asserted object is passed to is found through what fills the callee: a variable, a method of the layouts expected at the receiver and of the classes below them, a constructor, a static method, a capture, on either side of a branch. A callee that arrives as a parameter is not known: its functions keep their tests, and the call is recorded
